            "The project manager tracks the five milestones in a simple plan and checks at each sprint review that the Agile work is on course to meet them. If a sprint threatens the print deadline, scope is cut (fewer printed items, more digital) rather than moving the date. Our [sprint planning template](/templates/sprint-planning-template/) and [user story template](/templates/user-story-template/) support this kind of plan.",
